        "original_id": "e0116734-de64-5325-8f9f-284772f54b42",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John D. Rockefeller III, David Rockefeller, Abby Rockefeller, Nelson Rockefeller, Laurance Rockefeller, Winthrop Rockefeller\n- Organizations: Japan Society, Americas Society, Chase Manhattan Corporation\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- John D. Rockefeller III had siblings named Abby Rockefeller, Nelson Rockefeller, Laurance Rockefeller, Winthrop Rockefeller, and David Rockefeller.\n- David Rockefeller was born on June 12, 1915.\n- Japan Society suspended all activities during World War II.\n- David Rockefeller was an American banker who became chairman and chief executive of Chase Manhattan Corporation.\n- The Americas Society was established by David Rockefeller in 1965.\n- Japan Society expanded under the leadership of John D. Rockefeller III after World War II.\n- David Rockefeller died on March 20, 2017.",
